  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FEMINA STRATEGIC PLAN 2013-2017 - End of Term Evaluation 2017</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FEMINA STRATEGIC PLAN 2013-2017</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Femina targets young people ages 13 - 30 through its media platform.  It envisions a gender equal society in which youth are confident and  competent change makers who actively participate in the development   and wellbeing of Tanzania. Its mission is its expertise in strategic  communication and expensive partnership network to reach YP across Tanzania with critical knowledge and platform for conversation.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Femina targets young people ages 13 - 30 through its media platform.  It envisions a gender equal society in which youth are confident and  competent change makers who actively participate in the development   and wellbeing of Tanzania. Its mission is its expertise in strategic  communication and expensive partnership network to reach YP across Tanzania with critical knowledge and platform for conversation.</narrative>
  </description>
